    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have stage 2 hypertension and i've been on lisinopril for a bit now. my sinuses are totally clogged up and i feel gross. is it okay if i take some sudafed to help clear it out or is that gonna mess with my blood pressure too much?",
