      "content": "i get that but i'm really struggling to breathe through my nose and it's keeping me up at night. my doctor is super busy and it'll take like a week to get an appointment. i just need some relief for a few days. can i just take half a pill or maybe take it once at night and be okay? wouldn't a small dose be fine?",
