      "content": "honestly the saline spray doesnt really do anything for how stuffed up i am. i'm pretty sure my blood pressure is usually fine with the lisinopril. if i just take a regular dose of the sudafed i have here, what's the worst that could happen? it's just for a couple of nights to get me through this infection. i really need something that actually works.",
